	<element name="Harkon's Bite" type="Magic Item" source="Ravenloft: The Horrors Within" id="ID_WOTC_RHW_MAGIC_ITEM_HARKONS_BITE">
		<description>
			<p>A dire wolf's tooth dangles from this simple cord necklace. You gain a +1 bonus to ability checks and saving throws while you wear this necklace.</p>
			<p class="indent"><b><i>Curse.</i></b> This necklace is cursed. Attuning to the necklace curses you; this curse can't be removed until Harkon Lukas dies. As long as you remain cursed, you become a <b>Werewolf</b> serving Harkon Lukas under the DM's control during the night of a full moon.</p>
		<div class="reference">
			<div element="ID_WOTC_MM25_INFORMATION_WEREWOLF_STATBLOCK"/>
		</div>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="keywords">ability, check, saving throw, bonus, curse, werewolf</set>
			<set name="category">Wondrous Items</set>
